- **Growth Rate Scaling**: 10x variance in growth rates (0.02-0.2) 
- **Speed Adaptation**: 2.5x variance in transporter speeds (2.0-5.0)
- **Economic Strategy**: ~30% neutral ratio vs 50% development default
- **Time Optimization**: All algorithms must complete within 100ms hard limit

